Capsule's fix for SDL 3.4.18's Vulkan frame latency under vsync. A frame began once the previous one's
commands finished, and its GPU work then waited for an image the display still held, so its input
reached the screen a refresh later than Direct3D 12's. The swapchain wait now acquires the next image
and blocks until the display lets it go, and the frame uses that image. Drop it once SDL releases a fix.

